.TH NOTES-APP 1 "October 2026" "notes-app" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
notes-app \- modern, minimal note-taking app
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B notes-app
.SH DESCRIPTION
Notes is a small desktop note-taking app with live Markdown styling,
pinned notes, #tags, search and a light/dark theme.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/notes-app/notes/
Your notes, one Markdown file per note.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/notes-app/pinned.txt
The ids of pinned notes.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/notes-app/theme.txt
The chosen theme: system, light or dark.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B XDG_DATA_HOME
Where the data directory is located. Set it to a temporary folder to try the
app without touching your real notes.
